<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/6th-century">6th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">533 CE</h1><p class="ref-lede">533 CE in world history: 5 events and 2 deaths. 198 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
